{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1790993606,"nonce":"ISRClZe9vkd19qMMLVwCgYO2byk=","message":"Focus and disabled landed in 3477ac2:\n- ashui.input.Focus keeps one focused node per tree. Pressing a focusable node focuses it and pressing elsewhere blurs; Tab order is document order, skipping disabled nodes.\n- Interaction has focused, focusVisible (keyboard focus) and disabled signals. A disabled node and everything in it takes no presses, clicks or focus.\n- Tw has focus:, focus-visible: and disabled:, layered in Tailwind's order (dark, hover, focus, focus-visible, active, disabled); hxx has focusable={...} and disabled={...}, reactive.\n\nStill to do: focus-within:, group-hover: and peer-hover:, which need an element to read an ancestor's or sibling's Interaction.\n\nThe focus-visible:/disabled: smoke check fails only under Ash hybrid (Ash 6208fb0).","files":null}]}